{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:51:34+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:51:34+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Universal Music Group N.V.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","country":"Netherlands","city":"Hilversum","website":"https://www.universalmusic.com","employees":null,"summary":"Universal Music Group N.V. operates as a music company worldwide. The company operates through Recorded Music, Music Publishing, and Merchandising & Other segments. Its Recorded Music segment discovers and develops recording artists, as well as licenses, markets, promotes, distributes, and sells their music across various formats and platforms; and engages in the live events, sponsorship, film, and television operations. The Music Publishing segment discovers and develops songwriters, as well as owns and administers the copyright for musical compositions used in recordings, public performances, and related uses, such as films and advertisements. Its Merchandising & Other segment produces and sells artist and other branded products through various sales channels, including fashion retail, concert touring, and online, as well as offers brand rights management services. Universal Music Group N.V. was incorporated in 2020 and is headquartered in Hilversum, the Netherlands.","exchange":"Amsterdam","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Universal Music Group N.V. opère en tant que société de musique dans le monde entier. La société opère par le biais de la musique enregistrée, de l'édition musicale et des segments merchandising et autres. Son segment Recorded Music découvre et développe des artistes d'enregistrement, ainsi que des licences, des marchés, des promotions, des distributions et des ventes de leur musique à travers divers formats et plates-formes; et s'engage dans les événements en direct, le parrainage, le cinéma et le